; FINAL-USB enforcing-policy delta for the existing recovery-domain endpoint.
; The stock policy already grants recovery CAP_NET_ADMIN and tcp_socket
; create/ioctl.  Candidate 2 proved that socket creation is the next denied
; boundary.  These rules add only the server operations used by
; sweetdisplay_usbd and binding to the ordinary IPv4 node/port labels.

(allow recovery self (tcp_socket (ioctl read write create getattr bind listen accept setopt shutdown)))
(allow recovery node (tcp_socket (node_bind)))
(allow recovery port (tcp_socket (name_bind)))
